# Revenge of the Rats (CR 702.34a, 601.2f): its flashback cost is {2}{B}{B}. Faithless Looting discards it to Bot1's graveyard;
# four Moxen then give four mana but only one black (Jet; Pearl, Sapphire and Emerald are not), so casting it with flashback is
# refused for want of the second {B}, and it stays in the graveyard with no Rat made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Revenge of the Rats
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Revenge of the Rats; Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Revenge of the Rats
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Graveyard.Revenge of the Rats.Cast(Ability: Flashback; Mana: short)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Revenge of the Rats
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire
